WEBVTT

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.320
Hey Granny...

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:46.360
Hmm?

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.780
Do you know the boy sitting 
at the bench over there?

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.570
Ah, you mean Mio-kun?

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.220
He used to come buy our bread

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:59.660
with his mother when he was young.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.300
I'm back.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.920
I'm hungry!

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.300
Welcome home.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.470
Where's Suzu-chan?

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.430
Not coming, she says 
her overtime's not ending.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.470
Ah, Eri! Don't...

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:19.060
eat that yet...

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.600
Yummy!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:29.100
Umibe no Étranger

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.500
Wait up! Hurry up!

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.930
Good morning!

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.310
You're the boy who always sits here...

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.280
Shun...

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:57.490
Would you get some vegetables from the...

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:00.200
Oh, you're working?

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.580
Nope, it's okay.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.300
This is from Granny.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.220
Oh, thank you for everything.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.350
Shun-chan, eat this.

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:23.850
<i>Miyako Cafe</i>

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.600
I'm back.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:25.770
Oh, thanks.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:26.600
Right away!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.690
Coming!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:29.980
One curry...

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.270
And... Tako rice!

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.270
I'll help!

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.270
Please.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.610
Okay!

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:36.650
Excuse me. Where's the reception
desk for the lodgings?

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:38.290
Oh, right, right...

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.200
Please sit here and wait for a moment.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:42.950
Welcome!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.210
Who ordered draft beer?

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:48.120
Here!

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:52.170
I think we can order drinks.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.380
Coming!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.850
Hey, you!
Wait!

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:13.900
This is the shop's leftovers.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.280
Ah, aren't you hungry?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:18.900
Not really.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:20.410
Ah!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.700
Right, of course.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:25.580
I'm sure you have dinner waiting.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:29.710
Are you giving me that?

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.920
Eh?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.290
Ah, sure.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.920
Thank you very much.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.220
Oh no, it's nothing.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.230
Welcome back.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.320
Jeez, it just started 
pouring out of the blue.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.450
Good job.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:03.700
Thank you.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.950
Just now, Mio-kun came by.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.410
He says it's thanks for the bread.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.790
He split these from 
his mother's seedlings.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.340
Oh...

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.510
Mio-kun's mother passed away apparently.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:26.760
It had been always just 
the two of them and now he's alone.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.970
And he's still only in high school.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.060
I'm sure he's feeling lonely.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:44.990
Mio...

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:47.240
What do you want for dinner?

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.490
Curry.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:52.660
But we ate that yesterday
and the day before.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:53.750
Anything else?

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.080
Eh?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:56.750
Then, this!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.590
Is today no money day?

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.140
Nope, let's eat crab.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.100
Really?

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.220
Yeah.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:14.770
Crab!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.150
Crabrolls...

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.150
Thank you for the food!

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.530
Crabrolls...

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.660
Yummy!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.490
It's yummy, huh?

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.790
Yep! I want seconds!

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:36.460
Sure, as much as you want.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:46.630
Can I sit beside you?

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:51.970
Thanks.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.310
Thank you for the flowers.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:57.940
Yeah...

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:02.900
Hey, what are you always 
looking at from here?

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:05.450
Nothing in particular.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.280
Don't you feel lonely 
being always by yourself?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.460
What?!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.080
Huh? Sorry...

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.830
You're the one who is always looking at me!

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:21.710
It's creepy.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.710
Disgusting.

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.590
Hey, don't you think Hashimoto 
sometimes looks like a girl?

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.640
Ah, I get you.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:33.470
Maybe he's gay?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.180
Eww, my seat is right next to his!

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.230
God, I might be done for!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.450
Ah, you're awake.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.700
Suzu-chan?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.530
Oh, he's awake?

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:55.200
You collapsed again.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.450
Eh, no way!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.410
I'll take that.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.540
Shun, did something happen?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.290
Nope, nothing.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.880
Suzu-chan too, thanks.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.970
What is it?

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:16.100
It's just that the person that I like
happens to be the same gender.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.060
Why is that weird, I wonder...

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:27.610
What is that?

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:31.030
Work...

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.200
I heard that you write novels.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:38.120
Ah, but this is not my manuscript.
Just preparation...

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.330
Well, it doesn't really matter huh?

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.630
I said something mean.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:44.420
I am sorry.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:45.880
Huh?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.550
Why are you apologizing?

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:49.130
That was because I...

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:54.680
It's because everyone looks at me 
with those sympathizing eyes.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:56.810
Because I don't have a family.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.350
Sadness and loneliness...

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.150
That's something only I will understand.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.650
I don't want your pity when 
you don't even understand.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:09.440
I thought you were so too...

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.150
No!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:13.040
Ah, well,

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:18.910
I was just interested in you and 
wanted to try talking to you.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.370
It's just my ulterior motives.

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:24.750
What's with that?

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:29.670
What a dumb excuse.
It's like you're hitting on me.

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:33.430
But...

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:37.350
I'm glad...

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:44.310
Shun, what's for dinner?

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.560
Huh? Wait!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.020
Oh my?

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.940
Oh my! Oh my! Oh my! Oh my!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:47.110
Eri?!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:51.070
There's a pretty boy here again!

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.700
What's your business here today?

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:54.700
Eri!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.870
Oh, just the right timing!

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:00.580
Charge!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.160
Shun...

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:04.210
Yeah?

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:07.040
So your name's Shun?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.700
That's right.
The one you write with a 'horse' character.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.510
I'm Mio.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.510
Should we go home?

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.220
You write it with the word 
to 'fruit' and 'central'.

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:16.930
Ohh..

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:18.890
We have to go home and make dinner.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.850
Curry!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:21.680
Sure!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:28.400
Curry! Curry! Curry!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:30.230
Shun, you...

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.690
Hmm?

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.820
You suck at fishing.

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.030
<i>Notice: Off Day</i>

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.030
Hang on, where's the fish?

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.030
Couldn't catch one.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.620
Erm, Shun?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:41.620
Not even one?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.750
Shut up!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.750
I'm going home.

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:46.330
Huh?! What are you saying?!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.540
You're eating here too!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.500
Eh?

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:54.510
Well then,

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.840
thank you for the food!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.760
Thank you for the food.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:04.730
Mio-kun, you're good at cooking.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:07.560
Yeah, because I used to help out at home.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:08.690
I see.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:10.770
Here, Mio-kun.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.860
Thank you.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:16.110
This guy here doesn't improve at all.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.780
Just look at this.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.070
Then don't eat it.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:24.250
Shun was always worried about you.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.660
Eri! Don't say unnecessary stuff!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.290
But it's true!

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:29.830
"I wonder if he eats properly at home."

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.000
I'm sorry we're so noisy.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.380
"What about his age?"

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.300
Do you like curry, Mio-kun?

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.300
I didn't say that! Stop it!

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.420
Uh, I like...

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:38.300
Hmm?

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.390
How cute!

00:11:41.390 --> 00:11:43.260
Oh you! Just shut up and eat!

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.850
Look at you, so happy.

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:46.600
Eri!!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.690
Suzu! I want the fried chicken!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:49.100
Sure.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.940
Hey, are you listening?!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.520
Not at all.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.820
What?! And that's mine!

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:56.860
The potato salad is good.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.110
That's great.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.660
Ah, I ate too much.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.700
You have a good appetite.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.250
Shun?

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:09.120
Yeah?

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:12.840
I'm moving to the institution 
at the main island tomorrow.

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.840
Huh? Tomorrow?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:19.130
Eh, how about your contact, 
your phone number?

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:20.890
I don't have a phone.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.890
I can't do anything as a child.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.730
Shun,

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:35.360
once I get there, 
I'll call you.

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:01.380
Hey, Sensei, help out a bit!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.730
Don't call me Sensei.

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:08.730
Well, reality is like this.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.980
<i>Congratulations for being nominated</i>

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:09.980
Ah?!

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:14.060
And you two lovebirds are 
living happily in the love nest.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.340
How envious.

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:19.960
Excuse us for living in bliss, 
Dried-Tree Sensei!

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:19.960
<i>Note: Since he's doesn't have a relationship he dried off, has no fruit.</i>

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Shut up! Get out right now!

00:13:23.890 --> 00:13:27.080
Oh, the next tenant is coming soon, right?

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:29.870
Huh? I didn't hear anything about it.

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:33.400
Because Granny was saying she wants 
another pair of male hands to help out.

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:36.630
Well, whatever.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:41.880
Shun?

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.390
Are you sleeping?

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.140
It's been a while.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:56.850
Mio?

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.530
Shun, how have you been doing?

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:00.850
Eh?

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:04.020
The new tenant is you?

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:04.970
Yeah.

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.410
You're going to stay here?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.040
Yup, I'm 20 now.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:13.040
I remembered hearing from Eri-chan 
that I can be useful here now.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.540
I like you, Shun.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:20.300
So, Shun, fall in love with me too!

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.710
Huh?!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.280
Shun, good for you!

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:25.800
Eri!

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.670
You'll never find another guy 
as good as him again.

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:30.490
Shut up!

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:33.710
Don't you 'ehehe' me!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:36.440
Geez, what's wrong with you guys?!

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:37.020
Congrats!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.040
Congratulations!

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:38.820
Thank you!

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.320
This flower...

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:46.290
I planted the seedlings you gave us.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.700
It's been growing so much, 
just like you.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.700
I've grown quite a lot, right?

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:54.710
Hey, that's a joke, right?

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:59.210
About liking a guy.
There's nothing good about it.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.710
That's why I spent three years 
thinking about it.

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:04.070
That's just your misunderstanding.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.870
Maybe it is.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.940
Then...

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.310
It doesn't matter what the reason is.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:13.000
I want to be with you,

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.190
so I came back.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:19.980
Shun...

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:23.990
Somehow,

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.740
I'm hungry...

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.190
Eh?!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.120
Why now?!!

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:33.190
Oh well, let's eat something.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.980
No, wait!

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.120
Shun!

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.630
Oh right.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.150
Welcome back, Mio.

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:48.130
Because I haven't said it yet.

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:50.620
Yeah!

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:55.590
I'm back!

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.830
I'm here, Mom, Dad.

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.330
How are you today?

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.470
I'm home.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.460
It's so cool inside.

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:40.140
Ah, you haven't eaten your breakfast?

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.580
How is your progress?

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.820
Ugh, nothing at all..

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:49.990
Oh dear...

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:52.470
Good luck.

00:16:59.070 --> 00:16:59.390
Ah!

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.240
What about the thing I asked for?

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:02.900
Huh?

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:03.920
Cool pads.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:05.920
Ah! I forgot!

00:17:06.380 --> 00:17:07.560
Sorry!

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:10.630
It's time for my part-time, 
so I'll get them when I come back.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:12.160
Part-time?

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:13.890
Yeah, I'll be back by evening.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.760
I'll be going.

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.660
Here, please.

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:21.630
Okay.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.940
Thank you for waiting.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:27.870
Stewed pork and fried mixed veges.

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.930
Cutie boy, you're from one of the islands?

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:30.400
Cutie...?

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.160
Yes, I am.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.160
What's your name?

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:37.180
I'm Chibana.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.150
How old are you?

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:39.660
Twenty.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:40.930
So young!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.990
How about a girlfriend?

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:45.850
Oh, he turned red!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.920
How cute!

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:52.470
Shun, the bath is free now.

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:55.440
I'm tired, so I'm going to nap a while.

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:56.180
Eh?

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.970
Then can I sleep by your side today?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.110
Huh, of course not.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:02.940
Why not?

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.440
You're just so frank.

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:11.190
You really don't think of anything at all.

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.300
Mommy!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.250
This, you made this, Mio?

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:02.810
Yes! Was I helpful?

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:08.630
Yeah, very...
helpful...

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:10.090
Let's eat, let's eat!

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:17.310
Thank you for the food!

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:20.230
Oh, so delicious!

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:22.200
Thank you, Mio!

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:24.520
You're welcome!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.570
You didn't sleep?

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:37.750
Yeah.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:44.620
Mio!

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:48.960
I'll be going over tonight.
Do you have anything you want to eat?

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.200
Curry.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.700
You sure like it.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:56.590
And how's life living with 
Writer-sensei?

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:02.310
Well, quite normal, I guess.

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.770
Oh, you're here?

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.680
Oh my, Big-Shot Sensei.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:14.610
Huh?

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:18.740
You, pay more attention to him.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:20.190
What's with that attitude?

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:24.490
Faking being busy? How lame.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.190
It's not fake.

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:34.000
When's the deadline for that?

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:35.000
Yesterday.

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:36.450
Eh!

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.990
I'll make it on time if 
I hand it in tomorrow.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.010
Isn't that not making it on time?

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:45.690
Shun sure is busy.

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:47.060
You are too.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:47.770
Huh?

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:49.520
Serving customers and all...

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:52.520
Ah, the shop?
That's nothing.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:56.280
Cutie boy is so popular~~

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:00.230
Ow! That hurts! 
What's with that?!

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:07.790
Ah, Mio.

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.790
It's freshly fried.

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.460
Try some.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.650
I'll have one.

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:17.060
Geez, you're eating too much.

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:18.840
You ate some at home too, right?

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.830
Suzu's donuts sure are delicious.

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:23.530
Geez...

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:26.560
You sure get along well.

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:30.510
Yeah, right, because 
Suzu is so cute.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.660
Unlike for you.

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:34.410
Right, Shun?

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:37.940
What?

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:39.610
Did you finish it?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:40.450
Yeah...

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:42.570
I'm going to the main island for a bit.

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:43.950
Huh?

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.460
Why? Now?

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:48.220
I'm going to post it via airmail.

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:50.550
Ahh... Good job.

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.960
Then, why don't you go along, Mio?

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:56.960
Eh, but the shop...

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:00.910
It's fine.
We'll cover for you, right?

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:03.840
Eh? Yeah, sure.

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:05.100
Go ahead.

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:08.220
Okay.

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:12.770
Here you go.

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:15.980
Great job.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:18.980
Thanks.

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:21.990
What's that?

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:23.150
Huh?

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:23.990
Your cap.

00:22:24.600 --> 00:22:27.230
I'm not good at meeting people's eye.

00:22:27.230 --> 00:22:28.750
And there's a lot of people 
at the main island.

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:31.150
Huh? How so?

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:33.400
You talk normally to the customers, right?

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:37.650
That... I worked hard to be able 
to look at them in the eye.

00:22:37.650 --> 00:22:39.250
Really?

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:41.400
You sure are a hard worker.

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:44.840
Yep.

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:48.140
Why don't you find a girlfriend 
while you're at it?

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:50.770
What a waste.

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:52.270
Huh?

00:22:53.210 --> 00:22:54.520
What are you saying?!

00:23:01.700 --> 00:23:03.530
I'm going to the airport.

00:23:04.010 --> 00:23:04.900
What about you?

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:10.180
I'll go home myself.

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:33.680
Errr...

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:37.060
Do you like men?

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:40.320
I'm not interested in kids.

00:23:40.610 --> 00:23:42.200
No, that's not...

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:46.270
It's not like that...

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:52.830
I confessed to a guy

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:55.580
and kept thinking about it

00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:57.750
but I don't get it....

00:23:58.260 --> 00:23:59.700
That's...

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:01.310
That's why I want to ask 
about other things...

00:24:02.930 --> 00:24:04.340
Come anytime you like.

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:10.340
I can only serve you juice though.

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:16.480
<i>Mio</i>

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:16.480
<i>Mio</i>

00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:21.480
<i>Mio</i>

00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:21.480
<i>Mio</i>

00:24:19.980 --> 00:24:21.480
<i>Mio</i>

00:24:25.770 --> 00:24:28.440
Where are you now, Mio?

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:34.370
Shun, you might think I'm stupid 
for getting all hyped up alone

00:24:34.840 --> 00:24:37.870
and don't think about anything but...

00:24:38.460 --> 00:24:42.630
But even I... After separating from Shun, 
I thought of many things.

00:24:44.070 --> 00:24:46.880
I like you, Shun.

00:24:47.410 --> 00:24:51.720
But you don't feel the same.

00:24:52.510 --> 00:24:56.240
By coming back here, 
was I being a nuisance?

00:24:58.340 --> 00:24:58.810
Mio!

00:24:59.500 --> 00:25:00.540
Where are you now?

00:25:01.770 --> 00:25:05.300
Eh... Sakurazaka's Live House.

00:25:05.300 --> 00:25:07.600
I'll come over, so stay there.

00:25:18.650 --> 00:25:21.540
<i>Hey, don't you think Hashimoto 
sometimes looks like a girl?</i>

00:25:21.540 --> 00:25:23.470
<i>Ah, I get you.</i>

00:25:23.470 --> 00:25:25.530
<i>Maybe he's gay?</i>

00:25:25.530 --> 00:25:28.460
<i>God, I might be done for!</i>

00:26:01.170 --> 00:26:02.420
Mio...

00:26:04.420 --> 00:26:08.520
I thought you liked me...

00:26:08.520 --> 00:26:10.420
That's why I fell for you.

00:26:11.340 --> 00:26:13.430
That's why I came back.

00:26:14.510 --> 00:26:17.140
What I want is not a girlfriend!

00:26:20.370 --> 00:26:21.120
Come.

00:26:27.640 --> 00:26:28.860
Please.

00:26:28.860 --> 00:26:30.650
Thank you very much.

00:26:30.650 --> 00:26:35.390
Breakfast is from 6am 
to 9am at the canteen.

00:26:31.410 --> 00:26:33.460
Look at that.

00:26:33.460 --> 00:26:34.100
What?

00:26:34.100 --> 00:26:35.390
Really?

00:26:35.390 --> 00:26:37.850
Checkout is at 10am.

00:26:37.850 --> 00:26:39.650
No way, our eyes met.

00:26:40.910 --> 00:26:42.380
This is your room key.

00:26:43.000 --> 00:26:44.920
Please go up via that elevator over there.

00:26:44.920 --> 00:26:45.470
Okay.

00:26:46.860 --> 00:26:48.800
Eh, wait a sec...

00:26:49.820 --> 00:26:51.110
Hey, Shun.

00:26:53.030 --> 00:26:53.880
Wait a moment!

00:26:53.880 --> 00:26:55.470
Shun, wait-

00:27:15.210 --> 00:27:17.870
Why did you come back?

00:27:19.500 --> 00:27:25.830
Even though you'd be happier 
falling in love normally with a girl...

00:27:26.810 --> 00:27:31.500
I just can't help thinking of that 
every time when I see you.

00:27:42.820 --> 00:27:47.090
Hey, have you slept with 
a girl before?

00:27:47.090 --> 00:27:48.520
Well, yes...

00:27:49.010 --> 00:27:50.470
Me too.

00:27:50.470 --> 00:27:51.760
Can you do it?

00:27:51.760 --> 00:27:53.280
Somewhat.

00:27:53.710 --> 00:27:57.660
But I've never done it with a guy before.

00:27:58.830 --> 00:27:59.470
Eh?

00:28:00.170 --> 00:28:01.350
Never?!

00:28:01.350 --> 00:28:02.410
Why?!

00:28:03.020 --> 00:28:07.420
I've never confessed and 
he was my friend.

00:28:08.160 --> 00:28:11.670
If it's not going to turn out well, it was 
best to not say anything at all.

00:28:13.030 --> 00:28:16.670
But I called out to you.

00:28:16.670 --> 00:28:18.450
I feel somewhat childish.

00:28:20.820 --> 00:28:22.780
Shun, let's have sex!

00:28:22.780 --> 00:28:23.430
Huh?!

00:28:24.540 --> 00:28:26.180
I haven't slept for two days.

00:28:26.440 --> 00:28:27.790
It's fine!

00:28:27.790 --> 00:28:30.670
It's impossible, so out of the blue.

00:28:31.370 --> 00:28:34.360
It's okay if you put some effort into it!

00:28:34.360 --> 00:28:36.440
Hey, Shun, wake up!

00:28:51.000 --> 00:28:54.650
Ah, thanks for the riceballs.

00:28:58.860 --> 00:29:00.720
Geez...

00:29:03.320 --> 00:29:05.970
Why did you have to fall asleep?!

00:29:06.930 --> 00:29:07.790
You idiot!

00:29:29.190 --> 00:29:30.000
Shun...

00:29:31.310 --> 00:29:33.000
They say preparations are ready.

00:29:34.140 --> 00:29:36.380
Oh, you look beautiful.

00:29:38.020 --> 00:29:38.880
Hey...

00:29:39.590 --> 00:29:42.640
We are really going to be married.

00:29:43.160 --> 00:29:47.440
Are you really okay with that?

00:30:00.810 --> 00:30:02.530
Shun...

00:30:30.490 --> 00:30:31.200
Today, let's have sex-

00:30:31.200 --> 00:30:31.900
No.

00:30:32.930 --> 00:30:33.860
Eh?!

00:30:34.570 --> 00:30:36.390
You're noisy.

00:30:36.950 --> 00:30:40.550
Shun, you don't want to do it?

00:30:40.550 --> 00:30:41.570
I want to.

00:30:48.090 --> 00:30:50.080
I like you, Shun.

00:30:50.570 --> 00:30:52.330
I like you too.

00:30:55.810 --> 00:30:57.590
Hurry up and go to your part-time.

00:30:58.090 --> 00:30:59.330
Say it one more time.

00:30:59.330 --> 00:31:00.590
Not saying.

00:31:00.950 --> 00:31:03.590
Why not? Shun...

00:31:04.980 --> 00:31:06.140
Hurry up and go.

00:31:06.450 --> 00:31:08.290
I'll go so...

00:31:09.850 --> 00:31:10.660
Shun.

00:31:16.470 --> 00:31:18.230
Long time no see.

00:31:22.300 --> 00:31:24.090
Who's that?

00:31:24.890 --> 00:31:25.990
Childhood friend.

00:31:25.990 --> 00:31:28.370
You mean fiancee, right?

00:31:29.550 --> 00:31:30.870
Ex-fiancee.

00:31:31.290 --> 00:31:32.800
How did you know this place?

00:31:33.460 --> 00:31:35.000
What did you come here for anyway?

00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:38.250
Isn't that obvious?

00:31:40.230 --> 00:31:42.010
I've come to bring you back.

00:31:55.820 --> 00:31:57.350
I'm home.

00:31:57.350 --> 00:31:59.520
Oh, welcome home.

00:32:02.590 --> 00:32:05.280
I'm Sakurako.
Please excuse me for earlier.

00:32:05.280 --> 00:32:07.220
I'm Chibana.

00:32:07.820 --> 00:32:08.910
Nice to meet you.

00:32:09.140 --> 00:32:11.160
You're Shun's friend?

00:32:11.530 --> 00:32:13.170
Ah, yeah...

00:32:13.170 --> 00:32:14.370
That's not it.

00:32:15.300 --> 00:32:17.540
I've told you earlier,

00:32:18.110 --> 00:32:19.290
he's my lover.

00:32:19.650 --> 00:32:21.070
Oh, it's my manuscript.

00:32:21.070 --> 00:32:22.240
Yeah.

00:32:22.240 --> 00:32:24.050
I wonder how it is.

00:32:26.880 --> 00:32:27.680
<i>Hashimoto</i>

00:32:26.880 --> 00:32:27.680
What's with that?

00:32:28.070 --> 00:32:29.180
What's what?

00:32:29.730 --> 00:32:32.400
Is boyfriend a better word?

00:32:33.690 --> 00:32:35.060
No!

00:32:35.060 --> 00:32:36.930
Not that!

00:32:36.930 --> 00:32:38.190
What's that about the fiancee?

00:32:38.590 --> 00:32:42.440
I broke that off a long time ago and 
cut ties with my family then too.

00:32:44.980 --> 00:32:47.590
Oh, I see.

00:32:51.340 --> 00:32:52.200
What's wrong?

00:32:52.590 --> 00:32:56.040
My family told me to come back 
and show my face.

00:32:58.140 --> 00:33:00.460
It's easy for them to say.

00:33:01.330 --> 00:33:02.730
I'm going to take a bath.

00:33:04.550 --> 00:33:05.250
Okay.

00:33:11.390 --> 00:33:13.490
Can I have a moment?

00:33:15.260 --> 00:33:16.830
Okay...

00:33:16.830 --> 00:33:17.600
Where's Shun?

00:33:18.410 --> 00:33:21.480
Working.... Probably.

00:33:21.710 --> 00:33:23.250
I see.

00:33:23.250 --> 00:33:25.600
Then, it's fine with you.

00:33:25.600 --> 00:33:26.340
Eh?

00:33:27.480 --> 00:33:29.580
Even if you say to show you 
around the island,

00:33:30.410 --> 00:33:32.300
there's nothing but mountains and the sea.

00:33:32.750 --> 00:33:34.370
Then the mountains.

00:33:34.900 --> 00:33:36.490
You dislike the sea?

00:33:37.550 --> 00:33:39.870
My hometown is by the sea.

00:33:44.350 --> 00:33:44.880
Hey...

00:33:45.360 --> 00:33:46.030
Yes!

00:33:46.970 --> 00:33:49.660
Have you guys done it?

00:33:55.790 --> 00:33:56.950
Not yet?

00:34:00.350 --> 00:34:01.900
Shun is really good.

00:34:02.580 --> 00:34:04.270
He's careful and gentle.

00:34:05.390 --> 00:34:07.530
Why don't you let him do it soon?

00:34:08.280 --> 00:34:12.260
That person...
He couldn't do it all this time.

00:34:16.450 --> 00:34:22.540
Sakurako-san, did you perhaps
come here to reconcile with him?

00:34:22.730 --> 00:34:25.750
No way, of course not.

00:34:25.750 --> 00:34:27.550
So you haven't heard anything about us.

00:34:34.160 --> 00:34:37.080
Dad's health is declining.

00:34:34.160 --> 00:34:37.080
<i>Note: She addresses Shun's father as her own, as if she had really married him.</i>

00:34:38.220 --> 00:34:40.810
I've sent a letter.
Did it not arrive?

00:34:41.140 --> 00:34:42.300
It did.

00:34:42.300 --> 00:34:45.660
Is it that bad that you have to 
come and get him in person?

00:34:45.660 --> 00:34:48.070
He's not in immediate danger.

00:34:48.820 --> 00:34:53.700
But at this rate, 
he'll never go home.

00:34:55.440 --> 00:34:59.200
Why did you agree to marry Shun?

00:34:59.660 --> 00:35:01.450
Because Shun said it's okay.

00:35:02.010 --> 00:35:05.460
Even if you know that he's unable 
to fall in love with a girl?

00:35:05.820 --> 00:35:07.410
You <i>do</i> know about it, right?

00:35:17.300 --> 00:35:19.200
You guys, quit skipping practice.

00:35:19.200 --> 00:35:20.900
We're not skipping!

00:35:22.900 --> 00:35:25.030
Geez, fine, 5 minutes break.

00:35:26.850 --> 00:35:29.190
Hey, don't you think he's even 
more tired than us?

00:35:29.190 --> 00:35:30.230
Yeah.

00:35:39.920 --> 00:35:42.270
Hand it over properly.

00:35:44.570 --> 00:35:46.000
Are you not going to confess?

00:35:46.360 --> 00:35:48.210
Of course not.

00:35:48.210 --> 00:35:51.270
It might turn out okay this time.

00:35:52.030 --> 00:35:53.510
Definitely not.

00:35:54.230 --> 00:35:56.760
There's nothing definite.

00:35:57.380 --> 00:36:00.140
If you don't tell them, 
nothing will happen.

00:36:03.130 --> 00:36:04.890
You're so spineless.

00:36:07.230 --> 00:36:08.400
You wouldn't...

00:36:09.630 --> 00:36:10.900
...understand.

00:36:17.450 --> 00:36:20.910
You can do your writing anywhere, right?

00:36:21.390 --> 00:36:22.790
Just come home for once.

00:36:23.120 --> 00:36:24.040
Not going.

00:36:26.470 --> 00:36:29.900
Erm, I've sliced some watermelon.

00:36:29.900 --> 00:36:32.800
I have no intentions of going back now.

00:36:33.190 --> 00:36:35.100
What's with you anyway,

00:36:35.100 --> 00:36:37.050
coming all the way here to drag me back?

00:36:37.550 --> 00:36:39.800
Don't stick your nose into someone 
else's family problem.

00:36:40.230 --> 00:36:42.810
It doesn't concern you any longer now.

00:36:43.560 --> 00:36:45.060
Shun, that's-!

00:36:49.860 --> 00:36:51.060
I didn't think...

00:36:53.060 --> 00:36:54.820
...you were that stupid.

00:36:59.540 --> 00:37:01.820
Wait! Sakurako-san!

00:37:02.960 --> 00:37:05.610
Shun, hurry up and go after her!

00:37:05.610 --> 00:37:07.330
If you're here...

00:37:08.050 --> 00:37:09.330
Why do I have to go back?

00:37:09.990 --> 00:37:10.580
Me?

00:37:11.030 --> 00:37:11.830
Yeah!

00:37:13.280 --> 00:37:18.010
Aren't you just using me as an excuse?

00:37:18.790 --> 00:37:19.830
That's not-!

00:37:19.830 --> 00:37:20.840
Shun!

00:37:21.240 --> 00:37:24.350
Once he's dead, you'll never 
be able to see him again.

00:37:25.160 --> 00:37:26.100
I'm fine.

00:37:26.810 --> 00:37:29.350
I'm fine, so go back and see him.

00:38:02.980 --> 00:38:03.880
I, too...

00:38:14.320 --> 00:38:15.520
What is it?

00:38:21.460 --> 00:38:23.780
Running away and leaving your bride behind,

00:38:24.020 --> 00:38:26.530
plus saying that you like men!

00:38:26.810 --> 00:38:30.350
What the heck are you saying at this time?!

00:38:27.670 --> 00:38:28.490
Dear!

00:38:30.350 --> 00:38:32.290
That's not it, right, Shun?

00:38:32.510 --> 00:38:34.080
Say it's not true!

00:38:35.720 --> 00:38:39.050
<i>I didn't think you were that stupid.</i>

00:38:39.510 --> 00:38:41.390
<i>Go back and see him.</i>

00:38:41.390 --> 00:38:42.630
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:38:43.210 --> 00:38:44.140
<i>It's fine.</i>

00:38:45.700 --> 00:38:47.140
Ah, damn it!

00:39:02.080 --> 00:39:04.780
Okay, you two, look over here.

00:39:05.710 --> 00:39:08.280
Come on, both of you, smile.

00:39:11.140 --> 00:39:12.790
What a face.

00:39:14.000 --> 00:39:16.490
Isn't it fine? Aren't they cute?

00:39:16.490 --> 00:39:19.750
Aunty, I got some amazake.

00:39:19.750 --> 00:39:22.010
Oh, good for you.

00:39:22.010 --> 00:39:24.430
Shun was with you too, 
isn't that nice?

00:39:24.730 --> 00:39:29.810
Uncle, Aunty, I'm going to be Shun's bride.

00:39:31.150 --> 00:39:32.180
Oh, really?

00:39:32.180 --> 00:39:33.400
Good for you, Shun.

00:39:33.400 --> 00:39:36.000
It's true!

00:39:36.000 --> 00:39:37.190
We promised, right, Shun?

00:39:38.830 --> 00:39:39.440
Yeah...

00:39:39.930 --> 00:39:41.930
If it's Sakurako, it's fine.

00:39:48.000 --> 00:39:49.200
Sakurako-san!

00:39:49.690 --> 00:39:54.460
You can't go to such
a place alone at night!

00:39:54.790 --> 00:39:55.960
It's dangerous.

00:39:56.330 --> 00:39:57.210
Let's go back.

00:39:57.450 --> 00:39:58.460
Let me send you back.

00:39:59.670 --> 00:40:01.460
Why don't you stop him?

00:40:01.670 --> 00:40:06.290
Then Shun will stay here forever.

00:40:06.290 --> 00:40:10.470
Why? Why don't you say what 
you want and be selfish?

00:40:11.580 --> 00:40:14.470
But that... You're the same 
as well, Sakurako-san.

00:40:14.470 --> 00:40:15.980
I did say what I want!

00:40:16.740 --> 00:40:18.730
Even if he doesn't love me,

00:40:19.620 --> 00:40:21.980
I want to stay by his side.

00:40:23.370 --> 00:40:24.560
I told him...

00:40:29.180 --> 00:40:33.240
Someday, if Shun falls in love 
with someone else...

00:40:34.540 --> 00:40:37.500
If the one next to him isn't me,

00:40:38.320 --> 00:40:39.680
I'm still fine with it.

00:40:40.790 --> 00:40:42.000
Because the one to decide is Shun.

00:40:42.460 --> 00:40:47.180
You are able to say that 
because he needs you!

00:40:47.180 --> 00:40:49.070
I'm sorry.

00:40:51.070 --> 00:40:53.110
Why are you apologizing?

00:40:53.110 --> 00:40:54.720
What do you understand?

00:40:54.930 --> 00:40:55.980
I understand!

00:40:56.310 --> 00:41:01.110
That's because Shun is just as 
important to me as he is to you!

00:41:01.530 --> 00:41:03.110
That's why...

00:41:05.330 --> 00:41:06.360
I'm sorry...

00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:16.330
Why aren't you...

00:41:18.270 --> 00:41:22.540
...a more awful person.

00:41:28.150 --> 00:41:33.450
When I was young, my mother used to tell me 
that if I was alone, I'd be kidnapped.

00:41:34.170 --> 00:41:35.330
By the sea?

00:41:35.330 --> 00:41:36.980
Yeah, by the other side.

00:41:37.970 --> 00:41:39.730
But my mother passed away.

00:41:40.390 --> 00:41:43.150
Losing a family is a sad thing.

00:41:44.310 --> 00:41:46.780
That's why I don't want Shun to feel that.

00:41:48.330 --> 00:41:50.180
I want him to go back.

00:41:58.900 --> 00:42:00.290
Mio!

00:42:01.110 --> 00:42:02.290
Yes!

00:42:02.920 --> 00:42:04.790
Mommy!

00:42:05.360 --> 00:42:07.050
Yes!

00:42:07.530 --> 00:42:09.210
Carry me!

00:42:09.210 --> 00:42:10.250
Okay!

00:42:18.510 --> 00:42:21.490
Mommy, you smell nice.

00:42:22.610 --> 00:42:23.940
I love you!

00:42:27.070 --> 00:42:28.110
Mio!

00:42:31.820 --> 00:42:34.320
Why won't you answer your phone?

00:42:34.640 --> 00:42:36.570
I was worried!

00:42:36.570 --> 00:42:38.410
Oh, I didn't bring it with me.

00:42:38.410 --> 00:42:39.580
I left it in my room.

00:42:39.880 --> 00:42:42.580
There's no point of having 
a phone then, you idiot!

00:42:42.980 --> 00:42:44.820
And so?

00:42:44.820 --> 00:42:46.960
Where's Sakurako?

00:42:46.960 --> 00:42:48.510
I sent her back to her lodgings.

00:42:48.510 --> 00:42:50.010
Where's she staying?

00:42:50.010 --> 00:42:52.090
She said not to come today.

00:42:59.230 --> 00:43:00.600
I'm sorry.

00:43:01.490 --> 00:43:04.030
I'm sure you're super tired 
after everything.

00:43:04.030 --> 00:43:05.770
Huh? Not really?

00:43:08.460 --> 00:43:11.850
Yeah, you're right. You're the worst 
for saying such a thing to a girl.

00:43:12.320 --> 00:43:14.820
You have to be nice to girls.

00:43:15.550 --> 00:43:17.870
Even more so if you're an adult.

00:43:21.570 --> 00:43:22.810
Just kidding.

00:43:24.370 --> 00:43:25.150
Did I scare you?

00:43:26.080 --> 00:43:28.080
I am really sorry.

00:43:31.830 --> 00:43:33.260
It's fine.

00:43:33.260 --> 00:43:33.890
Hey...

00:43:33.890 --> 00:43:35.130
I'm done with you.

00:43:35.130 --> 00:43:36.350
Sakurako...

00:43:36.350 --> 00:43:38.170
Goodbye. May you find happiness.

00:43:38.170 --> 00:43:41.140
I'm just an outsider so 
I'll be excusing myself.

00:43:41.140 --> 00:43:46.060
Well, well, let's leave
it at that, Sakurako-san.

00:43:49.910 --> 00:43:52.970
Come back once. 
Your father...

00:43:52.970 --> 00:43:55.380
I know. I've read the letter.

00:43:55.380 --> 00:43:56.160
I see.

00:43:58.410 --> 00:43:59.160
Hey, Shun.

00:43:59.840 --> 00:44:01.370
Kiss me.

00:44:04.210 --> 00:44:06.060
Huh?! Wha-!

00:44:05.380 --> 00:44:07.170
I'll give up with that!

00:44:07.550 --> 00:44:08.830
It's fine, right?!

00:44:08.830 --> 00:44:11.170
You've never done it before.

00:44:12.290 --> 00:44:13.920
<i>Shun is really good.</i>

00:44:14.390 --> 00:44:16.680
<i>He's careful and gentle.</i>

00:44:20.180 --> 00:44:22.380
Sakurako, my...

00:44:43.230 --> 00:44:46.380
N-NOT YOU!!!!

00:44:46.380 --> 00:44:47.460
I'm sorry!

00:44:47.950 --> 00:44:50.710
Even if Shun's fine with it, I'm not!

00:44:51.620 --> 00:44:53.460
See you again, Sakurako-san!

00:44:56.730 --> 00:44:58.740
I'll never come back...

00:45:00.610 --> 00:45:01.910
to such a place....

00:45:06.020 --> 00:45:08.850
Ahhh.... What a storm.

00:45:09.550 --> 00:45:11.090
Geez...

00:45:11.090 --> 00:45:12.610
Time to go home and sleep.

00:45:12.870 --> 00:45:13.750
Hey...

00:45:15.330 --> 00:45:17.340
Ouch! Why...

00:45:17.340 --> 00:45:21.030
Why didn't you say no right away?!

00:45:21.550 --> 00:45:26.070
If I wasn't there to interfere, 
you would've just done it, right?!

00:45:28.170 --> 00:45:30.670
Huh? What?

00:45:31.330 --> 00:45:33.800
I don't care anymore!
You idiot!

00:45:43.930 --> 00:45:45.680
Hey, Mio.

00:45:45.680 --> 00:45:47.020
Shut up!

00:45:47.020 --> 00:45:48.350
What about dinner?

00:45:48.350 --> 00:45:49.190
Don't need it!

00:45:54.530 --> 00:45:57.490
Granny, Mio says he'll eat later.

00:45:57.490 --> 00:45:59.910
Oh my, did you fight?

00:46:03.200 --> 00:46:06.440
Then eat it together with him later.

00:46:06.440 --> 00:46:07.200
Yeah.

00:46:09.200 --> 00:46:09.980
Mio.

00:46:16.670 --> 00:46:17.720
I'm coming in.

00:46:20.040 --> 00:46:21.090
Mio.

00:46:21.420 --> 00:46:23.850
Hey... Are you still angry?

00:46:26.920 --> 00:46:28.600
Why are you...

00:46:30.930 --> 00:46:32.860
...such a crybaby?

00:46:33.650 --> 00:46:35.490
No. Stop it.

00:46:37.260 --> 00:46:38.420
I said no.

00:46:46.850 --> 00:46:48.740
I have you right here...

00:46:48.740 --> 00:46:51.940
Of course I'll say no to such a request.

00:46:55.230 --> 00:46:56.020
Wait!

00:46:56.020 --> 00:46:57.130
What?

00:46:57.130 --> 00:46:59.400
I'll take off my clothes! I want to!

00:47:00.930 --> 00:47:06.110
Hey, do you really want to do it?

00:47:06.440 --> 00:47:08.310
Of course! Why?

00:47:09.020 --> 00:47:09.770
Because...

00:47:10.430 --> 00:47:12.090
Isn't it disgusting?

00:47:12.090 --> 00:47:13.150
Of course not!

00:47:13.150 --> 00:47:14.590
What are you saying now?

00:47:15.180 --> 00:47:16.590
You, take off your clothes too!

00:47:40.680 --> 00:47:44.190
Mio, can you put it in?

00:47:45.050 --> 00:47:47.940
No way! I can't last that long!

00:47:47.940 --> 00:47:49.960
You've just came.

00:47:49.960 --> 00:47:52.390
It's fine if you put on two condoms.

00:47:52.390 --> 00:47:55.590
No, I can't! You can do it.

00:47:55.590 --> 00:47:57.900
I want you to put it in me!

00:47:58.540 --> 00:48:00.420
That's why I took a bath...

00:48:00.420 --> 00:48:01.810
And did other stuff....

00:48:02.380 --> 00:48:03.650
Other stuff?

00:48:04.280 --> 00:48:05.410
It's fine, so!

00:48:08.960 --> 00:48:10.060
I understand...

00:48:11.660 --> 00:48:14.410
I'm putting my finger in.

00:48:23.680 --> 00:48:24.170
Ah!

00:48:24.700 --> 00:48:25.910
Did you loosen yourself?

00:48:26.860 --> 00:48:29.030
Tell me about that properly!

00:48:29.030 --> 00:48:30.720
I'll do it next time!

00:48:31.950 --> 00:48:35.550
It's fine so put it in....

00:48:41.280 --> 00:48:42.940
I'm putting it in...

00:48:51.740 --> 00:48:54.080
How are you feeling?

00:48:54.990 --> 00:48:57.210
Not too well....

00:48:59.680 --> 00:49:00.710
<i>One day,</i>

00:49:02.410 --> 00:49:03.960
<i>with the person I fall in love with...</i>

00:49:04.290 --> 00:49:05.930
Of course...

00:49:06.840 --> 00:49:08.060
What should I do?

00:49:08.610 --> 00:49:10.060
It's fine.

00:49:10.940 --> 00:49:12.220
<i>If I'm able to hold them...</i>

00:49:13.630 --> 00:49:20.420
<i>Although that's something that will 
never come true, or so I thought...</i>

00:49:30.250 --> 00:49:31.730
Are you okay?

00:49:33.640 --> 00:49:34.480
You want some?

00:49:35.580 --> 00:49:36.750
No thanks.

00:49:37.560 --> 00:49:38.500
I'm good.

00:49:40.880 --> 00:49:42.220
How about some tempura?

00:49:42.220 --> 00:49:44.620
You can have them.

00:49:44.620 --> 00:49:45.630
You sure?

00:49:47.340 --> 00:49:48.670
Lucky~~

00:49:53.110 --> 00:49:56.590
I did nothing at all.

00:49:56.590 --> 00:49:58.820
Huh? But you did, all kinds of things.

00:49:58.820 --> 00:50:00.540
Not that, you idiot!

00:50:02.670 --> 00:50:08.900
I love you more than you think.

00:50:09.820 --> 00:50:11.530
Me too, I want to do 
something for you.

00:50:12.100 --> 00:50:13.030
You gave me this.

00:50:13.850 --> 00:50:15.790
That's not what I'm saying.

00:50:17.220 --> 00:50:18.790
I've already gotten it.

00:50:20.270 --> 00:50:22.790
I like girls.

00:50:22.790 --> 00:50:25.920
Even so, I fell in love with Shun.

00:50:30.510 --> 00:50:32.680
It's not weird falling in love with a guy.

00:50:41.150 --> 00:50:43.070
Hey, Mio.

00:50:43.070 --> 00:50:44.190
Yeah?

00:50:44.480 --> 00:50:46.550
I'll go back.

00:51:00.580 --> 00:51:01.510
Yeah.

00:51:06.200 --> 00:51:08.460
You've cleared out quite a bit.

00:51:08.730 --> 00:51:10.810
Yeah, little by little.

00:51:10.810 --> 00:51:12.330
I'm sorry it's so sudden.

00:51:12.330 --> 00:51:16.270
It's fine, go be a good son 
to your parents.

00:51:16.980 --> 00:51:20.410
Tell me if you need anything.

00:51:20.410 --> 00:51:22.370
Alright, thanks.

00:51:29.650 --> 00:51:32.360
Mio, what are you doing?

00:51:34.230 --> 00:51:35.240
What are you looking at?

00:51:35.780 --> 00:51:37.240
It's disgusting.

00:51:40.770 --> 00:51:42.250
Just kidding!

00:51:42.690 --> 00:51:45.940
Hey, is Hokkaido really cold?

00:51:45.940 --> 00:51:47.250
Make sure you don't catch a cold.

00:51:48.110 --> 00:51:49.370
I'll write you letters.

00:51:49.370 --> 00:51:51.420
Oh, but we have phones now.

00:51:51.420 --> 00:51:52.510
Are you alright?

00:51:53.540 --> 00:51:56.760
Mio, do you want to come along with me?

00:51:57.040 --> 00:52:01.840
Or would you wait here alone?
Just like I did...

00:52:07.990 --> 00:52:10.020
That's not it...

00:52:11.910 --> 00:52:12.610
Mio!

00:52:13.350 --> 00:52:14.490
Come with me!

00:52:15.110 --> 00:52:17.230
Let's go together, Mio!

00:52:20.460 --> 00:52:21.240
I'll go.

00:52:21.670 --> 00:52:22.720
I want to be with you.

00:52:23.750 --> 00:52:25.500
I don't want to be alone.

00:52:29.930 --> 00:52:31.320
Don't cry...

00:52:32.200 --> 00:52:33.260
I'm not crying!

00:52:36.500 --> 00:52:37.400
Hey, Shun...

00:52:38.260 --> 00:52:38.880
Let's go into the ocean!

00:52:39.340 --> 00:52:40.160
Come on!

00:52:41.270 --> 00:52:42.540
Wait, wait a sec!

00:52:43.510 --> 00:52:44.260
Mio!

00:52:46.000 --> 00:52:47.150
Uwahh, it's cold!

00:52:47.980 --> 00:52:49.020
Yeah it is!

00:52:50.100 --> 00:52:50.770
Shun...

00:52:51.890 --> 00:52:52.770
Thanks!

00:52:55.300 --> 00:52:56.340
I'm so happy!

00:52:58.380 --> 00:53:01.380
I don't really get it, 
but I'm glad!

00:53:16.150 --> 00:53:18.140
Well then, I'll be going.

00:53:18.790 --> 00:53:21.350
Take care, Mom, Dad.

00:53:33.310 --> 00:53:34.820
Caught it!

00:53:37.820 --> 00:53:39.070
We've gotta be going soon.

00:53:40.130 --> 00:53:40.570
Here you go.

00:53:52.420 --> 00:53:54.780
Well then, let's go.

00:53:55.660 --> 00:53:56.170
Huh?

00:53:58.010 --> 00:53:59.930
It's nothing.

00:53:59.930 --> 00:54:02.500
Shun! Mio!

00:54:02.500 --> 00:54:04.180
The ferry is departing!

00:54:04.620 --> 00:54:05.970
Okay!

00:54:13.570 --> 00:54:15.210
Mio!

00:54:21.330 --> 00:54:22.390
Yeah!

00:54:43.580 --> 00:54:48.140
Ah, I'm head over heels for you!

00:54:48.140 --> 00:54:52.780
I've already locked onto you!

00:54:52.780 --> 00:54:57.190
It must be fate, it's different from my previous loves

00:54:57.190 --> 00:55:00.150
Although I feel like I say that every time

00:55:02.070 --> 00:55:06.540
I put my soul into each and every approach!

00:55:06.540 --> 00:55:11.060
Ah, but every throw seems to be uncontrollable!

00:55:11.060 --> 00:55:15.660
But it's not easy to just give up

00:55:15.660 --> 00:55:18.490
Although I know it won't turn out well

00:55:20.230 --> 00:55:24.510
I wonder what talent is that? That fair skin and

00:55:24.510 --> 00:55:29.790
Those wide eyes and that pure voice

00:55:29.790 --> 00:55:34.380
And above all, that dressed up look

00:55:34.380 --> 00:55:38.300
That's your speciality, right?

00:55:42.410 --> 00:55:45.930
Ah, it would be pleasure if you would please marry me!

00:55:47.050 --> 00:55:50.460
But you shrank by how I said it!

00:55:51.370 --> 00:55:53.460
I wonder what in the world this is

00:55:53.460 --> 00:55:55.950
I don't know how to phrase my words

00:55:55.950 --> 00:55:59.050
I can't think of the best way to put it

00:56:00.500 --> 00:56:04.890
With the sense of on barely the passing line

00:56:04.890 --> 00:56:10.130
I used a phrase that hasn't been used before

00:56:10.130 --> 00:56:14.970
What's more is where my eyes land

00:56:14.970 --> 00:56:19.940
It is a place definitely unbefitting of you

00:56:44.720 --> 00:56:53.610
Although I have no business there, I walked along the 2nd floor corridor

00:56:53.610 --> 00:56:57.800
When you entered my sight

00:56:57.800 --> 00:57:02.970
That's really a huge lucky find!

00:57:02.970 --> 00:57:12.150
The muffler I borrowed was filled with your scent

00:57:12.150 --> 00:57:16.440
When you disappeared from my sight

00:57:16.440 --> 00:57:19.370
I wrapped it around myself and smelled it

00:57:19.370 --> 00:57:20.470
I wanted to do it

00:57:20.470 --> 00:57:21.750
But I didn't do it

00:57:23.960 --> 00:57:28.110
It's hard to describe

00:57:28.110 --> 00:57:33.230
Can't express all of my feelings

00:57:33.230 --> 00:57:37.300
It's hard to say it out loud

00:57:37.300 --> 00:57:42.370
What I want to express is this 'me'

00:57:42.470 --> 00:57:46.710
I cry, cry, cry and got tired of crying

00:57:46.710 --> 00:57:51.790
But this unsettling emotion

00:57:51.790 --> 00:58:00.260
If you're not here, I can't taste anything

00:58:04.410 --> 00:58:08.930
Ah, I'm head over heels for you!

00:58:08.930 --> 00:58:13.530
I've already locked onto you!

00:58:13.530 --> 00:58:17.960
There aren't many guys in this world who will fall head over heels

00:58:17.960 --> 00:58:20.950
I'm sure this means that we're meant to be together
